# Swift: SWIFT_OUTPUT (the Swift package directory; default: MODULE beside OUTPUT), SWIFT_MODULE
# (the Swift module; default: MODULE's snake_case words capitalized, features -> Features) and
# SWIFT_LIBRARY (the shared library the package links as -lNAME); PARTS splits the C++ library.
# Package.swift, Sources/SWIFT_MODULE/{SWIFT_MODULE,Rosetta}.swift and the C module are outputs.
# Pascal: PASCAL_OUTPUT (the Free Pascal unit; default: PASCAL_UNIT.pas beside OUTPUT), PASCAL_UNIT
# (the unit name; default: MODULE) and PASCAL_LIBRARY (the shared library the unit links; default:
# MODULE); PARTS splits the C++ library.
# Dart: DART_OUTPUT (the package directory; default: MODULE beside OUTPUT), DART_PACKAGE (the
# package name; default: MODULE in snake_case) and DART_LIBRARY (the native library the package
# loads; default: MODULE); PARTS splits the C++ library. pubspec.yaml, lib/DART_PACKAGE.dart and
# lib/src/rosetta.dart are outputs.
# Ada: ADA_OUTPUT (the directory of the package; default: OUTPUT's directory), ADA_PACKAGE (the
# package name; default: MODULE in Ada_Case) and ADA_LIBRARY (the native library the package links;
# default: MODULE); PARTS splits the C++ library. The spec, body and project file (lowercase
# package name: features.ads, features.adb, features.gpr) are outputs.
# Objective-C: OBJC_OUTPUT (the directory of the files; default: OUTPUT's directory), OBJC_PREFIX
# (the prefix of the generated names and files; default: MODULE in PascalCase) and OBJC_LIBRARY
# (the native library to link; default: MODULE); PARTS splits the C++ library. PREFIX.h and
# PREFIX.m are outputs.
